type: software
title: "Supporting files for How to Publish Five-Star Battery Data"
abstract: "The notebook that merges the JSON-LD metadata of the three case-study deposits of the article How to Publish Five-Star Battery Data into one graph and queries it, with the files it reads and its results, and the per-dataset results of the Battery Data Commons survey."
